  "summary": "RALEIGH, N.C., Jan. 08, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Enact Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: ACT) (Enact) announced it will issue its fourth quarter earnings release after the market closes on February 3, 2026. Enact will host a conference call to review fourth quarter 2025 financial results on February 4, 2026",
